flowchart TD
  A[Freeze task, source, tests and helpers] --> B[Baseline: ordinary repository discovery]
  A --> C[Context: instructions, skill and resolver]
  B --> D[Same Gemma model and bounded tools]
  C --> D
  D --> E[Read evidence and edit or decide]
  E --> F[Controlled verification]
  F -->|Feedback, within retry budget| E
  F --> G[Freeze final submission]
  G --> V{Timing audit valid?}
  V -->|No| X[Keep visible as invalid infrastructure]
  V -->|Yes| H[Independent healthy, fault and scope checks]
  H --> I[Semantic review or explicit pending state]
  I --> J[Private evidence to public summary]
  X --> J
  J --> K[GitHub workflow result feed]
  K --> L[Deployed dashboard refresh]
